sonora-rip (1.0.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First stable release.
  * Audio CD ripping with libcdio-paranoia; WAV and FLAC (libFLAC) output.
  * Red Book pre-emphasis detection with 50/15 us de-emphasis: automatic for
    flagged tracks, manual per-track control (GUI checkboxes,
    --deemph-tracks / --no-deemph-tracks) and a switch to disable automatic mode.
  * CDDB (gnudb) metadata: tags, "Artist - Album" folder, NN-Title file names.
  * SACD extraction front-end (sacd_extract + ffmpeg).
  * GTK 3 interface with Refresh button, editable tags, progress and cancel.

 -- Sonora Rip Maintainers <sonora-rip@example.org>  Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000

sonora-rip (0.1.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: CD ripping with pre-emphasis detection/de-emphasis,
    SACD extraction front-end.

 -- Sonora Rip Maintainers <sonora-rip@example.org>  Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
